  << /ActualText (Creative technologist working across software engineering and design\056 I build native apps\054 tools\054 and installations\056 With as much care for how a system feels as how it performs\056 My background spans UAL and Somerset House\054 moving fluidly between production code and physical\054 interactive work\056\nGraphic communication design meets full\055stack development\072 I sit at the point where design thinking becomes shipped software\056)
