810 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Lead Software Engineer \0502025 \055 Current\051\050Ambient Works\054 London \050Hybrid\051\nLeading development and release of an IoT companion app\054 from architecture through to shipped product\nBuilding internal and customer\055facing tools that make complex hardware feel simple\n\nTechnical Consultant \0502024 \055 2026\054 ongoing project basis\051\nIndependent \055 Louis Morl\346\054 Bold Tendencies \046 Tranen \nDelivered technical consultancy across three exhibitions for the same artist\054 spanning interactive software\054 robotics\054 and sculptural engineering\nBuilt a web scraper and sentiment analysis pipeline to drive the political positioning of three robot sculptures on a grid\054 based on scraped personality data\nEngineered a solar panel and wind sensor into a mobile rover\055like sculpture\054 wiring live environmental data into music mixing software\nDeveloped an interactive narrative chatbot with custom frontend for a Somerset House exhibition\n\050Design Engineer \0502024 \055 2025\051\050University of the Arts\054 London\nLed development of an AI\055powered search engine using LLMs and embedding models\nBuilt and maintained web applications supporting creative programs across the university\nWorked with faculty to bring technical solutions directly into how students learn\n\nVisiting Practitioner \0502023 \055 2025\051\050Creative Computing Institute\054 London\nMentored students in programming and creative computing\054 one\055to\055one and in groups\nSupported debugging and problem\055solving in practical sessions\nGuided the technical delivery of student creative\055technology projects)
     /K [ 10 ]
